<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 141 0 R
/T (NEXL: Elevate Your Learning is a specialized, AI-enhanced Learning Management System tailored for the Nepali educational landscape. Built on the MERN stack, NEXL bridges the gap between traditional learning and global standards by integrating local payment gateways \(eSewa/Khalti\) and leveraging advanced AI Transformers for content summarization and personalized recommendations. It empowers independent educators with affordable monetization tools while ensuring students have an interactive, accessible, and high-performance learning environment.)
/E (NEXL: Elevate Your Learning is a specialized, AI-enhanced Learning Management System tailored for the Nepali educational landscape. Built on the MERN stack, NEXL bridges the gap between traditional learning and global standards by integrating local payment gateways \(eSewa/Khalti\) and leveraging advanced AI Transformers for content summarization and personalized recommendations. It empowers independent educators with affordable monetization tools while ensuring students have an interactive, accessible, and high-performance learning environment.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [12]
>>
